# Supervisor builds from a fresh clone, so these are already absent there — but a
# local `docker build` would otherwise copy macOS-native node_modules over the
# Linux ones built inside the image, and better-sqlite3 would fail to load.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/dev-data
**/*.db
**/*.db-journal
**/*.tsbuildinfo
.git
.github
*.md
!cartridge_player/README.md
!cartridge_player/CHANGELOG.md
